  "answer": "This feature request has been filed before. Several tickets ask for a modifier key (Shift, Alt, Ctrl) plus the vertical mouse wheel to scroll horizontally in any app, for example Excel and Word. The main one is PowerToys#25646. Other tickets, such as #1153 and #27004, were closed as duplicates, and #1153 points to #25646 as the one tracking it. This feature isn't available in PowerToys yet. To help get it prioritized, add a thumbs-up and your use cases to #25646 instead of opening a new ticket. In the meantime, many apps already scroll horizontally with Shift + wheel. For apps that don't, such as Excel and Word, a third-party tool or an AutoHotkey script can emulate it. Those tickets mention AutoHotkey scripts as a common workaround."
